 "description": "16 November 2026: \"occurrence\" (1 when left out) and \"evidence\" (none for notMentioned or unknown, as the prompt says) are optional; a date or amount given as a bare normal form is accepted and normalised by `notes relabel --ingest`. \"normalized\" is optional: the guide (section 8) leaves it out for a relative date, a Hijri date and a foreign currency. \"actor\" is optional and read as unknown when left out (an Opus relabeller left it out on notMentioned elements, 17 November)."
